a4=g?"":'- "place" is, for a task tied to a place ("buy milk when I reach Shwapno", "call Ammu when I leave the office"), one of their saved places: '+B.b.aE(a4,", ")+'. "placeWhen" is "arrive" or "leave". Otherwise null. A task with a place needs no date.\n'
g=n?'- "remember": lasting facts about the person or their world that would help next time: who people are to them, their teams, places, preferences, routines, goals, what they study or own (like "Supports Manchester United", "Oishi is their sister", "Goes to the gym at 6 am on weekdays"). Short, third person, one fact each. Never one-off events, tasks, money amounts, moods, or passwords, ID or card numbers. If a fact above is repeated or confirmed by this note, return it again in the same words. Usually empty.\n':""
